# The Rites of Life (CoP 1-1, mission.cop.the_rites_of_life). A fresh char's CoP log has current 101, below The Rites
# of Life (110), so section 1 holds (ENABLE_COP 1). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok in Qufim Island warps into Lower
# Delkfutt's Tower (prevZone Qufim, [COP]TalesBeginning 0): 22, left open, finished with 0: [COP]TalesBeginning 1, the
# two Tales' Beginning NPCs enabled for the char, the partial mission log. A rezone keeps prevZone Qufim, but the var
# is 1: no 22; afterZoneIn (the var > 0) enables them again. Tales' Beginning: 53 (3), option 1: nothing; again, 53,
# option 4: 22 (0, 0, 0, 1); finished with 1: 36, 37, 38, 39 (hidden), 39's finish: the var > 0: enableEntities({}),
# the var 0; begun (current 110), Mission[6][110]Status 1. Section 4 (Status > 0) replaces the defaults in Ru'Lude
# Gardens: Auchefort 8, Baran 17, Colti 21. Upper Jeuno's zone-in (section 2, Status 1): 2, finished: Status 2.
# Rosaline 97 (section 4). Status 1 again (a GM): Monberaux: no section 3: his script. Status 2 (a GM): Monberaux 10,
# then 206, 207 started by each finish; 207's finish completes it: the Mysterious Amulet (reward keyItem), Below the
# Arks current (nextMission), the status not reset (CoP), cleanup (the Status var gone). Completed (current above
# 110): a rezone in Upper Jeuno plays no 2; Rosaline 97 and Auchefort 8 (section 4, completed).
warning: lua: addMission: overwriting current mission 101 of log 6 with 110 -- begin's addMission over the CoP log's fresh current 101 (Ancient Flames Beckon's category value; ZoneHost.Progress.cs logs it as C++ ShowWarning)
lists LowerDelkfuttsTower/onZoneIn/1 LowerDelkfuttsTower/afterZoneIn/1 LowerDelkfuttsTower/Tales_Beginning/onTrigger LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/22 LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/39 LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/53 UpperJeuno/onZoneIn/1 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/2 UpperJeuno/Monberaux/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Rosaline/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/207 RuludeGardens/Auchefort/onTrigger
char zone=QufimIsland pos=-286.271,-21.619,320.084 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
login
warp 460.022,-1.77,-103.442 LowerDelkfuttsTower open  # from Qufim, the var 0: 22 left open
finish option=0                         # not 1: [COP]TalesBeginning 1, the NPCs enabled, the partial mission log
rezone                                  # prevZone Qufim kept, the var 1: no 22; afterZoneIn: the NPCs enabled
trigger Tales_Beginning                 # section 1: 53 (3)
finish option=1                         # not 4: nothing
trigger Tales_Beginning                 # 53 (3)
finish option=4                         # 4: 22 (0, 0, 0, 1)
finish option=1                         # 1: 36 (hidden)
finish                                  # 37
finish                                  # 38
finish                                  # 39
finish                                  # the var > 0: enableEntities({}), the var 0; begun, Status 1
warp 4,2.5,100 RuludeGardens
trigger Auchefort                       # section 4 (Status 1): 8
finish
trigger Baran                           # 17
finish
trigger Colti                           # 21
finish
warp -4.2,1.3,47.5 UpperJeuno open      # section 2 (Status 1): 2 left open
finish                                  # Status 2
trigger Rosaline                        # section 4: 97
finish
charvar Mission[6][110]Status 1         # a GM: Status 1
walk -41.9,-0.5,-1.9                    # by Monberaux
trigger Monberaux here                  # no section: his script: 109 (the introduction), then 28
finish                                  # 109: the introduction seen
finish                                  # 28
charvar Mission[6][110]Status 2         # a GM: Status 2
trigger Monberaux here                  # section 3: 10
finish                                  # 206
finish                                  # 207
finish                                  # completed: the Mysterious Amulet, Below the Arks current, the Status var gone
rezone                                  # completed: no section 2: no 2
trigger Rosaline                        # section 4 (completed): 97
finish
warp 4,2.5,100 RuludeGardens
trigger Auchefort                       # section 4 (completed): 8
finish
